{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13705","headline":"从军行二首 二 · 顾况","name":"从军行二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年胆气麁，好勇万人敌。\n仗剑出门去，三边正艰厄。\n怒目时一呼，万骑皆辟易。\n杀人蓬麻轻，走马汗血滴。\n丑虏何足清，天山坐宁谧。\n不有封侯相，徒负幽幷客。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13705.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13705","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}